//raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery/configure-hr-service.md","line":34},{"title":"Configuring Employee Document Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/employee-document-management/configuring-employee-document-management.md","line":38},{"title":"HR Centers of Excellence data model","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery/hr-centers-of-excellence-coes.md","line":55},{"title":"HR Administration","target":"c_AdministerHRServiceManagement","line":61},{"title":"HR criteria","target":"hr-criteria","line":167},{"title":"Add or modify a retention policy","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/employee-document-management/hr-doc-management-config.md","line":169},{"title":"HR Service Delivery","target":"hr-service-delivery","line":289},{"title":"who is covered","target":"t_WhosCovered","line":345},{"title":"GlideFilter - Scoped, Global","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideFilterScopedAPI.md","line":411},{"title":"Manage HR roles","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery/c_ManageRoles.md","line":449},{"title":"Manage HR Groups","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery/t_ManageHRGroups.md","line":449},{"title":"HR profile","target":"c_HRProfileRecords","line":515},{"title":"Define policies for a document type","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/employee-document-management/hr-doc-management-config.md","line":515},{"title":"Manage HR roles","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery/c_ManageRoles.md","line":525},{"title":"Roles","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery/c_ManageRoles.md","line":525},{"title":"Manage HR Groups","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery/t_ManageHRGroups.md","line":525},{"title":"Groups","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery/t_ManageHRGroups.md","line":525},{"title":"Employee Document Management","target":"hr-employee-doc-management","line":742},{"title":"HR Administration","target":"c_AdministerHRServiceManagement","line":743},{"title":"HR criteria","target":"hr-criteria","line":744},{"title":"HR Service Delivery","target":"hr-service-delivery","line":745},{"title":"Who is covered","target":"t_WhosCovered","line":746},{"title":"HR Profile","target":"c_HRProfileRecords","line":747}],"metadata":{"title":"Defining and setting for employee documents","description":"Use Employee Document Management to configure how employee documents should be handled based on company policy, processes, and regulatory compliance.For each document type, you can determine who can access a document as well as define the retention policies associated with it, or place a legal hold. A document type can manage multiple documents.A retention period defines how long an employee document should be saved before being discarded. Retention periods are combined with conditions or criteria to form a retention policy.Default retention policies ensure that employee documents are not mistakenly purged. When a retention policy has not been assigned to a document type, the default retention policy is used.Set policies determining how long documents should be retained and who is covered. Retention policies combine the retention period and conditions or criteria.Default security policies ensure that employee documents are secure. The HR Service Delivery base system provides default security policies for each document type and determines who can access and has purge authorization.Many employee documents contain confidential and personal information. Use document security policies to define access to employee documents and ensure that they are secure.Add or modify expiration notification policies on a document type. Allow setting an expiration date on a document and sending email notifications to document owners, managers, or HR representatives when the document expires or nearing its expiration.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/employee-service-management/employee-document-management/hr-doc-management-config.html","release":"australia","product":"Employee Document Management","classification":"employee-document-management","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":15,"breadcrumb":["Configure","Employee Document Management","HR Documents","HR Service Delivery","Employee Service Management"],"tags":["#employee-service-management","#documents","#storage","#classification","#hr","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/employee-service-management/employee-document-management/hr-doc-management-config.md"},
